  "comments": "Work on the theory of definition composed in thal 'phreng (chains of consequences) style, without citations or references to other works and scholars.\r\n\r\nIt could correspond to the \"tshad ma'i thal phreng mdor bsdus\" listed in the Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 675, No. 11849). \r\n\r\nThe colophon gives the date of composition as: sa pho spre'u'i la nag pa'i zla ba'i gnam (The year of the male earth monkey, in the waxing moon of the third month. As the author would only have been 7 years old in 1368, 1428 is more likely.",
